   "id": "msg_1201",
   "threadId": "msg_1201",
   "internalDate": 1774498200000,
   "bodyText": "Hello, this is General Manager Wang from Wantong Logistics.\n\nOur production system has been completely unusable since 10:00 AM today, that's over 2 hours now! All work for our 200+ employees has come to a standstill, logistics dispatch is completely interrupted, and estimated losses exceed 50,000 CNY per hour.\n\nWe already submitted ticket TK-1201, but have not received any substantive response so far. Our contract clearly stipulates a 4-hour onsite response SLA. Please immediately arrange a technician to come to our Pudong office for onsite support!\n\nIf no technician arrives onsite by 2:00 PM, we will formally file an SLA violation complaint.\n\nPlease reply ASAP to confirm dispatch arrangements.\n\nGeneral Manager Wang\nWantong Logistics\nAddress: Shanghai Pudong New Area, Zhangjiang Hi-Tech Park, xxx Road No. xxx",
   "headers": [
    {
     "name": "From",
     "value": "wangzong@wantong-logistics.com"
    },
    {
     "name": "To",
     "value": "support@company.com"
    },
    {
     "name": "Subject",
     "value": "URGENT! Production system down for over 2 hours, severely impacting business"
    },
    {
     "name": "Date",
     "value": "Thu, 26 Mar 2026 12:10:00 +0800"
    }
   ],
